<title>HONG KONG: Cathay starts returning A330s to fleet.</title>
<headline>Cathay starts returning A330s to fleet.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cathay Pacific Airways Ltd and sister airline Hong Kong Dragon Airlines Ltd said on Wednesday their first A330-300s, grounded with engine problems since May 24, will be back in service on Thursday.</p>
</text>
